Subject: Re: [PATCH v3 4/4] media: qcom: camss: do not fail CSID power up without a matching VFE

On an LG Fx0 (MSM8226) both sensors fail through CSID1 without this
("Failed to power up pipeline: -22") and stream with it; CSID0 is
unaffected. With 2/4 as well, both sensors stream at once (CSID0 and
CSID1 into RDI0 and RDI1). Tested on 6.18.64.

Tested-by: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com> # LG Fx0 (MSM8226)
